    {
      "subId": "201804",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Kujou Takayuki",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "20180403"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "20180403": {
            "id": "20180403",
            "speakerId": 3053,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Takayuki",
            "text": "Stop! Sara, have you gone insane!? How dare you disregard my orders!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180404"
            ]
          },
          "20180404": {
            "id": "20180404",
            "speakerId": 1038,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Sara",
            "text": "M—Master, I...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180405"
            ]
          },
          "20180405": {
            "id": "20180405",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Go on, ask him! Don't let him intimidate you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180406"
            ]
          },
          "20180406": {
            "id": "20180406",
            "speakerId": 1038,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Sara",
            "text": "...Master Takayuki, I've seen the report to the throne and the letter to the Fatui... Please, tell me why!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180407"
            ]
          },
          "20180407": {
            "id": "20180407",
            "speakerId": 3053,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Takayuki",
            "text": "So this is how my documents went missing from headquarters? You stole them...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180408"
            ]
          },
          "20180408": {
            "id": "20180408",
            "speakerId": 1038,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Sara",
            "text": "Should I take your words to mean that... these documents were not forgeries? They were really penned by your own hand?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180409"
            ]
          },
          "20180409": {
            "id": "20180409",
            "speakerId": 1038,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Sara",
            "text": "Please tell me, Master, I need to know... Has the Tenryou Commission really... betrayed the Shogunate!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180410"
            ]
          },
          "20180410": {
            "id": "20180410",
            "speakerId": 3053,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Takayuki",
            "text": "Hmph... Yes, I have dealings with the Fatui. And yes, the report you saw was penned by my hand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180411"
            ]
          },
          "20180411": {
            "id": "20180411",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Heh, he just came right out and admitted it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180412"
            ]
          },
          "20180412": {
            "id": "20180412",
            "speakerId": 3053,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Takayuki",
            "text": "The diplomats from Snezhnaya promised a very generous reward indeed... and all they requested of me in return was to see that the Vision Hunt Decree is upheld.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180413"
            ]
          },
          "20180413": {
            "id": "20180413",
            "speakerId": 3053,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Takayuki",
            "text": "For too long, the Kujou Clan's position has been coveted by so many. There is no shortage of clans who would tear us down at the first opportunity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180414"
            ]
          },
          "20180414": {
            "id": "20180414",
            "speakerId": 3053,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Takayuki",
            "text": "So, when the chance arose to gain the backing of another powerful nation and crack down on our enemies at the same time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180415"
            ]
          },
          "20180415": {
            "id": "20180415",
            "speakerId": 3053,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Takayuki",
            "text": "It appeared to me to be an excellent deal. I simply saw no need to inform you, Sara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180416"
            ]
          },
          "20180416": {
            "id": "20180416",
            "speakerId": 1038,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Sara",
            "text": "But... you worship the Shogun. How can you betray her after all this time and act like it's nothing!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180417"
            ]
          },
          "20180417": {
            "id": "20180417",
            "speakerId": 3053,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Takayuki",
            "text": "Betrayal? How can you call this a betrayal?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180418"
            ]
          },
          "20180418": {
            "id": "20180418",
            "speakerId": 3053,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Takayuki",
            "text": "The Fatui may think they are using me, but the reverse is true. What could they possibly hope to achieve?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180419"
            ]
          },
          "20180419": {
            "id": "20180419",
            "speakerId": 3053,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Takayuki",
            "text": "When the lightning strikes in Inazuma, they shall fall to their knees and tremble, paralyzed by fear and trepidation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180420"
            ]
          },
          "20180420": {
            "id": "20180420",
            "speakerId": 3053,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Takayuki",
            "text": "After all...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180421"
            ]
          },
          "20180421": {
            "id": "20180421",
            "speakerId": 3053,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Takayuki",
            "text": "None can contend with the supreme power of the Almighty Raiden Shogun and the Musou no Hitotachi!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180424"
            ]
          },
          "20180424": {
            "id": "20180424",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah... he doesn't worship the Raiden Shogun herself, but her power as a warrior — especially the Musou no Hitotachi. In fact, he seems to be way too into it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180425"
            ]
          },
          "20180425": {
            "id": "20180425",
            "speakerId": 1038,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Sara",
            "text": "But Master... what about loyalty?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180426"
            ]
          },
          "20180426": {
            "id": "20180426",
            "speakerId": 1038,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Sara",
            "text": "Ever since I was adopted by the Kujou Clan, you taught me the importance of loyalty from servants to their superiors...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180427"
            ]
          },
          "20180427": {
            "id": "20180427",
            "speakerId": 1038,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Sara",
            "text": "But it's clear to me now that you wanted my loyalties to stop with the Kujou Clan. So you were scared that I would betray you one day?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180428"
            ]
          },
          "20180428": {
            "id": "20180428",
            "speakerId": 1038,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Sara",
            "text": "You hypocrite! Preaching about virtue just to mask your own wretched selfishness!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180429"
            ]
          },
          "20180429": {
            "id": "20180429",
            "speakerId": 3053,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Takayuki",
            "text": "Selfishness? I am but safeguarding the eternity of the Kujou Clan. I'm quite sure the Almighty Shogun would be sympathetic to that, as would the former head of our clan.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20180430"
            ]
          },
          "20180430": {
            "id": "20180430",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hate to say it, but his ego is getting in the way. If he thinks the Kujou Clan is a match for the Fatui, Paimon thinks he's in for a nasty surprise..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
